quest\">Bear Room Quest</a>.<br/>\n12 of these are needed for <a href=\"#/quest/the-postman-missions-quest\">The Postman Missions Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Arthom%20the%20Hunter\">Arthom the Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elder%20Bonelord\">Elder Bonelord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf\">Elf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Arcanist\">Elf Arcanist</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scout</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Damselfly\">Emerald Damselfly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Hero</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernoid%20Hound\">Infernoid Hound</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Henchman\">Lizard Henchman</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lizard%20Swordmaster\">Lizard Swordmaster</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Memory%20of%20an%20Elf\">Memory of an Elf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Omruc\">Omruc</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pirate%20Navigator\">Pirate Navigator</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poacher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rabid%20Wolf\">Rabid Wolf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ragged%20Rabid%20Wolf\">Ragged Rabid Wolf</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Salamander\">Salamander</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Troll%20Champion\">Troll Champion</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:cen